{
  "brandName": "Sleepyhead",
  "findings": [
    {
      "section": "overview",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Sleep and home-comfort range",
      "text": "Sleepyhead’s official site presents a broad home-comfort range including mattresses, beds, sofas, sofa beds, recliners, pillows and other home furnishings. The site describes the brand as Indian.",
      "sourceIds": ["source-1"]
    },
    {
      "section": "products",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Original mattress details",
      "text": "The Original is presented as a medium-firm, three-layer memory-foam mattress featuring BodyIQ technology. Its product page lists a 10-year warranty and a 100-night free trial. These are page-stated product details, not independent efficacy evidence.",
      "sourceIds": ["source-4"]
    },
    {
      "section": "identity",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Supplied identity guidance",
      "text": "The supplied Sleepyhead guideline excerpts describe a human-centred, young/vibrant, quirky and fabulous identity, with a Jester archetype focused on connection and enjoyment. The excerpts are partial; their original version and approval status are not established.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "asset-aae80100-00e7-4b25-ad96-67df3e41702f", "asset-c4381a7b-d5aa-46af-95a9-7e2150bd0e23"]
    },
    {
      "section": "identity",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Colour, typography and mark",
      "text": "Guideline excerpts specify orange #F15A22 and charcoal #414042, and name Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web typography. The supplied white specification conflicts: RGB 255,255,255 implies #FFFFFF, while the printed hex is #231F20; treat #FFFFFF as an interpretation pending correction. The guide describes a lowercase wordmark and closed-eye “ee” motif; no production logo artwork or Migrena Grotesque font files are supplied.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "asset-f455e529-b2b2-4944-b889-624c926d6bcf", "asset-808c6451-265c-43e1-aa67-53fafd54f52d", "asset-d40ad768-1016-434e-af72-e29b24fc08ac"]
    },
    {
      "section": "tone",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Conversational, playful voice",
      "text": "Supplied voice guidance favours humorous, informal, creative and personable language, including wit and wordplay, while remaining useful and clear and avoiding unsupported product promises.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "asset-fe0205c8-6774-40f4-9b95-f0e6827e968e"]
    },
    {
      "section": "creative",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Whole-room inspiration, not a fixed template",
      "text": "The client-selected spatial board is advisory inspiration, not a mandatory brand rule or Sleepyhead product evidence. Its supplied research describes expressive domestic spaces using colour, pattern, rounded forms, daylight and lived-in activity, alongside quieter alternatives. The bounded image subset includes a peach sectional in a bright room and an open-plan room with architectural colour zoning; these are references, not exact Sleepyhead products.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0", "asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8", "asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455"],
      "assetIds": ["supplied-asset-library-asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8", "supplied-asset-library-asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455"],
      "direction": "exploration"
    },
    {
      "section": "opportunities",
      "basis": "inference",
      "title": "Build scenes around the exact product",
      "text": "A useful creative approach is to anchor a scene in the selected Sleepyhead SKU and variant, then borrow spatial principles—such as realistic circulation, a coherent colour relationship and signs of everyday use—from the advisory references. Do not transfer reference furniture, product features or claims to Sleepyhead.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0", "doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "source-4"],
      "direction": "exploration"
    },
    {
      "section": "conflicts",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Guideline authority and claim limits",
      "text": "The supplied guideline excerpts are partial and lack an established original version or approval stamp; their direction should retain that qualification. Separately, the official Original product page uses claims such as pressure relief, spinal alignment and orthopedic support. Treat these as on-page product claims, not independent substantiation or permission to extend them.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "source-4"]
    }
  ],
